    "description": "Run a procedure without dialogs and return its return values as JSON. Give arguments by name: images and layers as ids, files as absolute paths, colors as "#rrggbb", choices and enums by name, units as pixel, inch, or mm, and arrays as JSON arrays. Arguments not given keep the defaults pdb_describe lists; give a value for each one whose default is null, such as an empty string for an unused name. run-mode is always non-interactive.",
